<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104841" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίβων</span></b>  (A) [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ωνος</span>, ὁ,</span>
		but ἡ in <i><span class="en">
			<u>PGiss.</u>
			76.2
		</span></i>
		<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίβω</span>):—
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>worn garment, threadbare
				cloak,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				282.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				184
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				343
			</span></i> (troch.), al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				92.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				519.11
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				7451.149
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>: worn by the Spartans, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Αακωνίζειν καὶ τρίβωνας ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					54.34
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Duris
				14J.
			</span></i>; by Philosophers, as Socrates, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				219b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Prt.</u>
				335d
			</span></i>; esp. by the Cynics, <i><span class="en">
				Crates Theb.
				16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				3.1.24
			</span></i>, etc.; and the Stoics, <i><span class="en">
				Zeno Stoic.
				1.63
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πήρα καὶ τ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.332a
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Peregr.</u>
				15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				6.13
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ τὴν χλαῖναν ἐν τῷ θέρει
					κατατρίψαντες ἐν τῷ τ. τὸν χειμῶνα διάγουσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.Med.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
			</span></i>inc.<i><span class="en">
				21.17
			</span></i>:— 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στολή τις ἔχουσα σημεῖα ὡς
					γαμμάτια</span>
			 acc. to <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				766.6
			</span></i>.</div>
